- R>W | ask the council for its reasons in writing, and answer each one by next spring | v: stimulation, conformity | aim: ease | foot: door learned a skill | chance: 80
- G>U | let the forum go, and keep the winter's notes for whoever tries next | v: tradition, universalism | aim: stop | foot: lesson the notes will keep | chance: 80
works: The rules start to be kept on the hill, and people begin to call them the common's rules.
works: The block matters less than it did, and the users go on talking to each other.
fails: The new way in is slower than it sounded, and the sheep go up before anything is settled.
fails: A few of the users lose patience with the delay and go back to doing as they please.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- U B, Strategic Innovator: openness versus advantage (pull, cycle A)

== an exclusive licence for the method
tier: life event
shape: any
kind: chance
rungs: 2 3
fork: take
style: U B
route: systems_inventor, enterprise_builder
stages: young_adult adult mature elder
