scene: The method {N} worked out is spreading: small makers copy the published plans, improve them and send back their changes. Now a large firm offers to license it exclusively, with enough money to build a proper works around it and a team to keep it safe as it spreads. The offer stands for six weeks, and it would mean taking the plans down.
