roles: partner, colleague, keeper, neighbour
earth: {Ns} firm has stopped growing for two years at the limit its springs and woodland can carry, and a second site is for sale
tribal: the camp's herd has stopped growing at what the grazing can carry, and a second valley lies open to the west
magic: the estate's trade has stood still for two years at what its springs can bear, and a second estate is offered for sale
scene: The firm {N} built on how the valley's springs and woodland renew themselves has stood still for two years: it sells everything it makes, and it makes as much as the land can carry. A second site upstream is for sale until autumn. Buying it would double the firm. The springs there feed the same river, and nobody yet knows how much more the river can give.
scene tribal: The camp's herd has stopped growing for two summers, at what the grazing can carry. A second valley lies open to the west, but its water feeds the same river as the camp's own. The clans meet in autumn.
scene magic: The estate's trade has stood still for two years at what its springs can bear. A second estate upstream is offered until the autumn quarter, and its springs feed the same river.
- W | keep the firm at its present size, and run it as well as possible | v: conformity, security | aim: work | foot: mark kept your word | chance: 80
- U | spend a year measuring the river before deciding anything about the second site | v: self-direction, universalism | aim: ease | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 78
- B | buy the second site, and work out the water as the firm grows into it | v: achievement, power | aim: work | foot: means money-.10 | chance: 60
- R | buy it, and try a completely new way of growing there that takes less water | v: stimulation, self-direction | aim: work | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 53
- G | let growth go, and keep the firm a living the valley can carry | v: universalism, tradition | aim: stop | foot: lesson enough is a real size | chance: 77
- W>U | buy only if the river keepers agree a limit on what both sites draw | v: conformity, self-direction | aim: work | foot: person keeper | chance: 60
- U>B | license the method to the second site's buyer instead, and grow by teaching | v: self-direction, power | aim: work | foot: lesson growth can be shared | chance: 65
- B>R | buy it with a partner, and let the partner carry the risk on the water | v: power, stimulation | aim: work | foot: person partner | chance: 57
- R>G | invite the river's other users to plan the second site together | v: stimulation, benevolence | aim: work | foot: person neighbour | chance: 67
- G>W | let the second site go this year, and look again when the river is known | v: security, conformity | aim: ease | foot: means time+.04 | chance: 77
works: Whichever way it went, the river is still running at the year's end, and {N} knows why.
works: The firm finds a shape it can hold, and {N} sleeps better for having chosen it.
fails: The numbers and the river disagree, and the year is spent arguing with both.
fails: The choice leaves {N} unsettled, wondering whether it was nerve or wisdom.

