scene tribal: {mentor} kept the camp's herd for fifty summers and never let it outgrow the grass. The herd did well, and the grazing is richer now than before. {mentor} offers to teach {N} through the summer.
scene magic: {mentor} served as forester of the crown's woods for fifty years and sold only what the wood grew each year. The woods are greater for it. {mentor} offers {N} a season of lessons.
