scene tribal: For three summers {N} has led the young into the far gorge, and they have brought back stories and no answer. They want to go deeper next summer. The old ones say the answer may be in the stories already.
scene magic: For three seasons {N} has led a company into the far gorge, and the college's shelves are heavy with notes. The company wants to go deeper. The masters say the answer may already be on the shelves.
