- B>G | share the credit for each finding with whoever made it, by name | v: achievement, benevolence | aim: work | foot: person colleague | chance: 77
- R>W | lead the hardest climbs, and still be the last one writing at night | v: stimulation, conformity | aim: work | foot: means health-.04 | chance: 65
- G>U | ease the rule to every second night, and use the spare nights to think | v: security, self-direction | aim: ease | foot: means time+.03 | chance: 77
works: The reports reach home night after night, and people start waiting for them.
works: By the end of the six weeks the valley is on the map, and the team is still speaking to each other.
fails: A storm keeps the team pinned down for days, and the reports dry up.
fails: The nightly rule wears everyone thin, and the last week is grim.

